### DataGouv Prix Carburant API (France)
### Real-time fuel prices from data.economie.gouv.fr
### Docs: https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/prix-des-carburants-en-france-flux-instantane-v2/api/

@baseUrl = https://data.economie.gouv.fr/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/prix-des-carburants-en-france-flux-instantane-v2

### Get stations near Paris (10km radius)
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?where=within_distance(geom, geom'POINT(2.3522 48.8566)', 10km)&limit=50
Accept: application/json

### Get stations near Lyon (10km radius)
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?where=within_distance(geom, geom'POINT(4.8357 45.7640)', 10km)&limit=50
Accept: application/json

### Get national averages (sample of 100 records)
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?limit=100
Accept: application/json

### Get a specific station by ID (replace ID)
@stationId = 75015001
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?where=id="{{stationId}}"
Accept: application/json
